</tbody></table></div></section><section class="section" id="tracking"><h2><span class="en">How to track your posting activity</span><span class="es">Cómo seguir tu actividad de publicaciones</span><span class="zh">如何 Tracking 自己的 Posting Activity</span><span class="zh-tw">如何 Tracking 自己的 Posting Activity</span></h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3><span class="en">Posting Activity chart</span><span class="es">Gráfico de actividad de publicaciones</span><span class="zh">Posting Activity 图表</span><span class="zh-tw">Posting Activity 圖表</span></h3>
<div class="checklist"><div class="check"><div><span class="en"><b>Daily target</b> is assigned by Admin and used as the target line.</span><span class="es">El objetivo diario lo asigna el administrador y se usa como línea objetivo.</span><span class="zh"><b>Daily target</b> 由 Admin 设置，图表中的目标线按这个数字显示。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Daily target</b> 由 Admin 設定，圖表中的目標線按這個數字顯示。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Each date shows saved posts for that date.</span><span class="es">Cada fecha muestra las publicaciones guardadas para ese día.</span><span class="zh">每个日期显示该日已经保存到系统里的 Post。</span><span class="zh-tw">每個日期顯示該日已經儲存到系統裡的 Post。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en"><span class="status good" data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</span> = Admin passed the post review.</span><span class="es">Good = el administrador aprobó la revisión de la publicación.</span><span class="zh"><span class="status good" data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</span> = Admin 审核通过。</span><span class="zh-tw"><span class="status good" data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</span> = Admin 審核通過。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en"><span class="status bad" data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</span> = Admin marked the post as needing attention.</span><span class="es">Bad = el administrador marcó la publicación como que necesita atención.</span><span class="zh"><span class="status bad" data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</span> = Admin 判定该 Post 有问题。</span><span class="zh-tw"><span class="status bad" data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</span> = Admin 判定該 Post 有問題。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en"><span class="status neutral" data-help-static-en="Unreviewed" data-help-static-es="Unreviewed">Unreviewed</span> = saved, but no Good/Bad decision yet.</span><span class="es">Unreviewed = guardada, pero aún sin decisión Good/Bad.</span><span class="zh"><span class="status neutral" data-help-static-en="Unreviewed" data-help-static-es="Unreviewed">Unreviewed</span> = 已保存，但 Admin 尚未做 Good/Bad 判定。</span><span class="zh-tw"><span class="status neutral" data-help-static-en="Unreviewed" data-help-static-es="Unreviewed">Unreviewed</span> = 已儲存，但 Admin 尚未做 Good/Bad 判定。</span></div></div></div></div>
<div><h3><span class="en">Channels filter</span><span class="es">Filtro de canales</span><span class="zh">Channels 筛选</span><span class="zh-tw">Channels 篩選</span></h3><p class="en">Use All / Facebook / Instagram / OfferUp / Craigslist to filter the dashboard chart and post list by platform. This is a viewing filter only; it does not edit posts.</p><p class="es">Usa All / Facebook / Instagram / OfferUp / Craigslist para filtrar por plataforma el gráfico y la lista de publicaciones. Es solo un filtro de visualización; no modifica publicaciones.</p><p class="zh">使用 All / Facebook / Instagram / OfferUp / Craigslist 按平台筛选图表和 Post 列表。它只改变你看到的数据，不会修改 Post。</p><p class="zh-tw">使用 All / Facebook / Instagram / OfferUp / Craigslist 按平臺篩選圖表和 Post 列表。它只改變你看到的數據，不會修改 Post。</p><div class="callout"><span class="en">The current submission verifier accepts Facebook Marketplace, OfferUp and Craigslist URLs. The dashboard can still display/filter any platform already stored by the system.</span><span class="es">El verificador de envíos actual acepta URL de Facebook Marketplace, OfferUp y Craigslist. El Panel aún puede mostrar y filtrar cualquier plataforma ya guardada en el sistema.</span><span class="zh">当前 Bulk Submit 验证器接受 Facebook Marketplace、OfferUp、Craigslist 链接；Dashboard 仍可显示/筛选系统中已有的其他平台数据。</span><span class="zh-tw">目前 Bulk Submit 驗證器接受 Facebook Marketplace、OfferUp、Craigslist 連結；Dashboard 仍可顯示/篩選系統中已有的其他平臺數據。</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="posts"><h2><span class="en">Posts, filters and post details</span><span class="es">Publicaciones, filtros y detalles</span><span class="zh">Post、筛选与详情</span><span class="zh-tw">Post、篩選與詳情</span></h2><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th data-help-static-en="Item" data-help-static-es="Elemento">Item</th><th data-help-static-en="Meaning / 含义" data-help-static-es="Significado">Meaning / 含义</th><th data-help-static-en="Click behavior / 点击行为" data-help-static-es="Comportamiento al hacer clic">Click behavior / 点击行为</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="All" data-help-static-es="All">All</td><td><span class="en">All posts in the selected date/channel range.</span><span class="es">Todas las publicaciones del rango de fecha/canal seleccionado.</span><span class="zh">当前日期和平台范围内的全部 Post。</span><span class="zh-tw">目前日期和平臺範圍內的全部 Post。</span></td><td><span class="en">Removes the review-status filter.</span><span class="es">Quita el filtro de estado de revisión.</span><span class="zh">取消状态筛选。</span><span class="zh-tw">取消狀態篩選。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Good" data-help-static-es="Good">Good</td><td><span class="en">Posts marked Good by Admin.</span><span class="es">Publicaciones marcadas Good por el administrador.</span><span class="zh">Admin 标记 Good 的 Post。</span><span class="zh-tw">Admin 標記 Good 的 Post。</span></td><td><span class="en">Shows only Good posts.</span><span class="es">Muestra solo publicaciones Good.</span><span class="zh">只显示 Good。</span><span class="zh-tw">只顯示 Good。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Bad" data-help-static-es="Bad">Bad</td><td><span class="en">Posts marked Bad by Admin.</span><span class="es">Publicaciones marcadas Bad por el administrador.</span><span class="zh">Admin 标记 Bad 的 Post。</span><span class="zh-tw">Admin 標記 Bad 的 Post。</span></td><td><span class="en">Shows only Bad posts so you can find issues quickly.</span><span class="es">Muestra solo publicaciones Bad para localizar problemas rápidamente.</span><span class="zh">只显示 Bad，便于快速找出问题。</span><span class="zh-tw">只顯示 Bad，便於快速找出問題。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Unreviewed" data-help-static-es="Unreviewed">Unreviewed</td><td><span class="en">Admin has not decided Good/Bad yet.</span><span class="es">El administrador aún no ha decidido Good/Bad.</span><span class="zh">Admin 尚未给出 Good/Bad。</span><span class="zh-tw">Admin 尚未給出 Good/Bad。</span></td><td><span class="en">Shows posts waiting for review.</span><span class="es">Muestra publicaciones pendientes de revisión.</span><span class="zh">显示等待审核的 Post。</span><span class="zh-tw">顯示等待審核的 Post。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Post card / View details" data-help-static-es="Tarjeta de publicación / Ver detalles">Post card / View details</td><td><span class="en">Saved post summary.</span><span class="es">Resumen de la publicación guardada.</span><span class="zh">已保存 Post 的摘要。</span><span class="zh-tw">已儲存 Post 的摘要。</span></td><td><span class="en">Opens Post Details: image, status, published time, title, description, platform and Post ID.</span><span class="es">Abre Detalles de publicación: imagen, estado, hora de publicación, título, descripción, plataforma e ID de publicación.</span><span class="zh">打开 Post Details，查看图片、状态、发布时间、标题、描述、平台和 Post ID。</span><span class="zh-tw">打開 Post Details，查看圖片、狀態、發布時間、標題、描述、平臺和 Post ID。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Image" data-help-static-es="Imagen">Image</td><td><span class="en">Listing image if one was fetched.</span><span class="es">Imagen del anuncio, si se obtuvo una.</span><span class="zh">抓取到的 Listing 图片。</span><span class="zh-tw">抓取到的 Listing 圖片。</span></td><td><span class="en">In Post Details, click the image to view it larger.</span><span class="es">En Detalles de publicación, haz clic en la imagen para verla más grande.</span><span class="zh">在详情里点击图片可放大。</span><span class="zh-tw">在詳情裡點擊圖片可放大。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Open original" data-help-static-es="Abrir original">Open original</td><td><span class="en">Original Marketplace listing.</span><span class="es">Anuncio original de Marketplace.</span><span class="zh">Marketplace 原始帖子。</span><span class="zh-tw">Marketplace 原始貼文。</span></td><td><span class="en">Opens the original URL in a new tab.</span><span class="es">Abre la URL original en una nueva pestaña.</span><span class="zh">新标签页打开原始链接。</span><span class="zh-tw">新標簽頁打開原始連結。</span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div></section><section class="section" id="submit"><h2><span class="en">Bulk Submit Post: current workflow</span><span class="es">Bulk Submit Post: flujo actual</span><span class="zh">Bulk Submit Post：当前操作流程</span><span class="zh-tw">Bulk Submit Post：目前操作流程</span></h2><div class="numbered">
<div><h3>Open Bulk Submit Post</h3><p class="en">Use Bulk Submit Post on the Dashboard or Bulk Submit in the top navigation. This is the normal Sales submission workflow.</p><p class="es">Usa Bulk Submit Post en el Panel o Bulk Submit en la navegación superior. Este es el flujo normal de envío de Ventas.</p><p class="zh">点击 Dashboard 的 Bulk Submit Post，或顶部导航的 Bulk Submit。这就是 Sales 当前统一的提交入口。</p><p class="zh-tw">點擊 Dashboard 的 Bulk Submit Post，或頂部導航的 Bulk Submit。這就是 Sales 目前統一的提交入口。</p></div>
<div><h3>Paste one or many listing URLs</h3><p class="en">Paste one complete Marketplace listing URL per line. A batch may contain one URL or many URLs.</p><p class="es">Pega una URL completa de Marketplace por línea. Un lote puede contener una o muchas URL.</p><p class="zh">每行粘贴一个完整 Marketplace 帖子 URL。一次可以只有一条，也可以多条。</p><p class="zh-tw">每行貼上一個完整 Marketplace 貼文 URL。一次可以只有一條，也可以多條。</p></div>
<div><h3>Submit to the background queue</h3><p class="en">Valid entries are placed in Verification Queue. Duplicate/invalid entries are surfaced as Errors; Passed entries are promoted to Posts.</p><p class="es">Las entradas válidas pasan a Verification Queue. Los duplicados/no válidos aparecen como Errors; Passed se convierte en Posts.</p><p class="zh">有效链接进入 Verification Queue。Duplicate/Invalid 会进入 Errors；验证通过的 Passed 会自动成为正式 Posts。</p><p class="zh-tw">有效連結進入 Verification Queue。Duplicate/Invalid 會進入 Errors；驗證通過的 Passed 會自動成為正式 Posts。</p></div>
<div><h3>Review queue results</h3><p class="en">Use Edit &amp; Re-verify, Retry or Delete on failed items. A failed queue item is not counted as a Post.</p><p class="es">Usa Edit &amp; Re-verify, Retry o Delete en los elementos fallidos. Un elemento fallido no cuenta como publicación.</p><p class="zh">失败项可用 Edit &amp; Re-verify、Retry 或 Delete；失败队列项不会计入 Post。</p><p class="zh-tw">失敗項可用 Edit &amp; Re-verify、Retry 或 Delete；失敗隊列項不會計入 Post。</p></div>
</div></section><section class="section" id="duplicates"><h2><span class="en">What duplicate checking means</span><span class="es">Qué significa la comprobación de duplicados</span><span class="zh">查重是什么意思</span><span class="zh-tw">重複檢查是什麼意思</span></h2><p class="en">The submit workflow checks more than one identifier. It can compare the submitted URL / platform post ID and later compare saved content against existing same-platform posts and the Admin-managed Company Website Library.</p><p class="es">El flujo de envío comprueba más de un identificador. Puede comparar la URL enviada / ID de publicación de plataforma y luego comparar el contenido guardado con publicaciones existentes de la misma plataforma y con la Biblioteca del sitio web de la empresa administrada por Admin.</p><p class="zh">Submit 流程不是只比 URL。系统会先检查 URL / 平台 Post ID，之后还会把抓取到的内容与同平台已保存 Post、以及 Admin 维护的 Company Website Library 做比较。</p><p class="zh-tw">Submit 流程不是只比 URL。系統會先檢查 URL / 平臺 Post ID，之後還會把抓取到的內容與同平臺已儲存 Post、以及 Admin 維護的 Company Website Library 做比較。</p>
<div class="cards"><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="URL / Post ID duplicate" data-help-static-es="Duplicado de URL / ID de publicación">URL / Post ID duplicate</h4><p class="en">Usually blocks saving because the same listing is already recorded.</p><p class="es">Normalmente bloquea el guardado porque el mismo anuncio ya está registrado.</p><p class="zh">同一 URL 或 Post ID 已记录时通常会阻止重复保存。</p><p class="zh-tw">同一 URL 或 Post ID 已記錄時通常會阻止重復儲存。</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Title / description comparison" data-help-static-es="Comparación de título / descripción">Title / description comparison</h4><p class="en">Warnings help you identify substantially repeated content.</p><p class="es">Las advertencias ayudan a identificar contenido sustancialmente repetido.</p><p class="zh">标题/描述比较会提示高度重复的内容。</p><p class="zh-tw">標題/描述比較會提示高度重復的內容。</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Website reference comparison" data-help-static-es="Comparación con referencia del sitio web">Website reference comparison</h4><p class="en">Admin can import company website titles, descriptions and image URLs; these become additional duplicate sources.</p><p class="es">Admin puede importar títulos, descripciones y URL de imágenes del sitio web de la empresa; se convierten en fuentes adicionales de duplicados.</p><p class="zh">Admin 可导入公司网站标题、描述、图片 URL，作为额外查重来源。</p><p class="zh-tw">Admin 可導入公司網站標題、描述、圖片 URL，作為額外重複檢查來源。</p></div><div class="card"><h4 data-help-static-en="Image comparison" data-help-static-es="Comparación de imágenes">Image comparison</h4><p class="en">Uses indexed images when available. A warning should be reviewed, not ignored automatically.</p><p class="es">Usa imágenes indexadas cuando están disponibles. Una advertencia debe revisarse, no ignorarse automáticamente.</p><p class="zh">有可用索引图片时会参与图片比较；出现 warning 时应人工确认。</p><p class="zh-tw">有可用索引圖片時會參與圖片比較；出現 warning 時應人工確認。</p></div></div></section><section class="section" id="delete"><h2><span class="en">How a Sales user deletes a post</span><span class="es">Cómo elimina una publicación un usuario de Ventas</span><span class="zh">Sales 如何删除 Post</span><span class="zh-tw">Sales 如何刪除 Post</span></h2><div class="callout danger"><span class="en"><b>Sales cannot directly hard-delete a post.</b> Sales sends a deletion request to Admin.</span><span class="es">Ventas no puede eliminar permanentemente una publicación directamente. Ventas envía una solicitud de eliminación al administrador.</span><span class="zh"><b>Sales 不能直接永久删除 Post。</b>Sales 只能向 Admin 发送删除申请。</span><span class="zh-tw"><b>Sales 不能直接永久刪除 Post。</b>Sales 只能向 Admin 發送刪除申請。</span></div>
<div class="numbered"><div><p class="en">On Dashboard, click the post card or <b>View details</b>.</p><p class="es">En el Panel, haz clic en la tarjeta de publicación o en Ver detalles.</p><p class="zh">在 Dashboard 点击 Post 卡片或 <b>View details</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">在 Dashboard 點擊 Post 卡片或 <b>View details</b>。</p></div><div><p class="en">In Post Details, click <b>Request deletion</b>.</p><p class="es">En Detalles de publicación, haz clic en Solicitar eliminación.</p><p class="zh">在 Post Details 点击 <b>Request deletion</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">在 Post Details 點擊 <b>Request deletion</b>。</p></div><div><p class="en">Enter <b>Reason for deletion</b>. The reason is required.</p><p class="es">Introduce Motivo de eliminación. El motivo es obligatorio.</p><p class="zh">填写 <b>Reason for deletion</b>，原因必填。</p><p class="zh-tw">填寫 <b>Reason for deletion</b>，原因必填。</p></div><div><p class="en">Click <b>Send request</b>. The system sends the request to Admin's Information Center.</p><p class="es">Haz clic en Enviar solicitud. El sistema envía la solicitud al Centro de información del administrador.</p><p class="zh">点击 <b>Send request</b>，申请会进入 Admin 的 Information Center。</p><p class="zh-tw">點擊 <b>Send request</b>，申請會進入 Admin 的 Information Center。</p></div><div><p class="en">Admin either rejects the request or approves it. Approval permanently removes the post and dependent post records.</p><p class="es">El administrador rechaza o aprueba la solicitud. La aprobación elimina permanentemente la publicación y sus registros dependientes.</p><p class="zh">Admin 可以 Reject，也可以 Approve &amp; Delete。批准后会永久删除该 Post 及其相关记录。</p><p class="zh-tw">Admin 可以 Reject，也可以 Approve &amp; Delete。批準後會永久刪除該 Post 及其相關記錄。</p></div></div></section><section class="section" id="verification-current"><h2><span class="en">Current verification and background queue workflow</span><span class="es">Flujo actual de verificación y cola en segundo plano</span><span class="zh">当前验证与后台 Verification Queue 流程</span><span class="zh-tw">目前驗證與背景 Verification Queue 流程</span></h2>
<div class="cards"><div class="card"><h4>Bulk intake checks</h4><p class="en">When Bulk Submit is sent, the system first checks whether each URL is a supported Marketplace URL and whether a hard duplicate is already known. Valid items continue automatically into background verification; no separate manual pre-check is required.</p><p class="es">Al enviar Bulk Submit, el sistema comprueba primero si cada URL pertenece a un Marketplace compatible y si ya existe un duplicado directo. Los elementos válidos continúan automáticamente a la verificación en segundo plano; no se requiere una comprobación manual separada.</p><p class="zh">提交 Bulk Submit 后，系统会自动先检查 URL 是否属于支持的平台以及是否存在硬重复；有效项目会自动继续进入后台验证，不需要再执行单独的手动预检查。</p><p class="zh-tw">提交 Bulk Submit 後，系統會自動先檢查 URL 是否屬於支援的平台以及是否存在硬重複；有效項目會自動繼續進入背景驗證，不需要再執行單獨的手動預檢查。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Verification Queue</h4><p class="en">Bulk Submit places valid listings into the background Verification Queue. Waiting, Verifying and Errors are not counted as Posts; Passed items are saved as Posts. Failed items can be opened and handled with Edit &amp; Re-verify, Retry or Delete. The queue keeps running if the page is refreshed.</p><p class="es">Bulk Submit coloca los anuncios válidos en Verification Queue en segundo plano. Waiting, Verifying y Errors no cuentan como publicaciones; Passed se guarda como publicación. Los elementos fallidos pueden gestionarse con Edit &amp; Re-verify, Retry o Delete. La cola sigue ejecutándose aunque se actualice la página.</p><p class="zh">Bulk Submit 会把有效帖子放进后台 Verification Queue。Waiting、Verifying、Errors 都不计入 Post；Passed 才会保存为正式 Post。失败项可使用 Edit &amp; Re-verify、Retry 或 Delete 处理；刷新页面也不会停止后台队列。</p><p class="zh-tw">Bulk Submit 會把有效貼文放進背景 Verification Queue。Waiting、Verifying、Errors 都不計入 Post；Passed 才會儲存為正式 Post。失敗項可使用 Edit &amp; Re-verify、Retry 或 Delete 處理；重新整理頁面也不會停止背景隊列。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Facebook verification status</h4><p class="en">Facebook provider date text is normalized before verification. Provider-specific values such as ISO timestamps, Unix timestamps or “Listed 59 minutes ago” are converted into the internal published date. If the listing exists but no publish date can be normalized, the queue shows <b>Date Not Verified</b>. If a provider explicitly confirms that the Marketplace listing was removed or is no longer available, the queue shows the separate <b>Unavailable</b> status. Provider timeouts, rate limits or login/challenge responses remain <b>Provider Error</b>.</p><p class="es">El texto de fecha de Facebook se normaliza antes de la verificación. Valores como timestamp ISO, Unix o “Listed 59 minutes ago” se convierten a la fecha interna. Si el anuncio existe pero no se puede normalizar su fecha, la cola muestra <b>Fecha no verificada</b>. Si un proveedor confirma explícitamente que el anuncio fue eliminado o ya no está disponible, la cola muestra el estado separado <b>No disponible</b>. Los timeouts, límites o páginas de login/challenge siguen siendo <b>Error del proveedor</b>.</p><p class="zh">Facebook 的 Provider 日期会先标准化再验证：ISO 时间、Unix timestamp、以及 “Listed 59 minutes ago” 等都先转换成系统内部日期。帖子存在但无法得到可验证发布日期时，Queue 显示 <b>日期未验证</b>；Provider 明确确认帖子已删除/下架/不可用时，单独显示 <b>帖子不可用</b>。Timeout、Rate Limit、登录墙/Challenge 仍然属于 <b>Provider 错误</b>。</p><p class="zh-tw">Facebook 的 Provider 日期會先標準化再驗證：ISO 時間、Unix timestamp、以及 “Listed 59 minutes ago” 等都先轉換成系統內部日期。貼文存在但無法得到可驗證發布日期時，Queue 顯示 <b>日期未驗證</b>；Provider 明確確認貼文已刪除/下架/不可用時，單獨顯示 <b>貼文不可用</b>。Timeout、Rate Limit、登入牆/Challenge 仍然屬於 <b>Provider 錯誤</b>。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Duplicate scope</h4><p class="en">Duplicate checks stay platform-scoped. Facebook compares against Facebook records and the Company Website Library, OfferUp against OfferUp records, and Craigslist against Craigslist records. Exact duplicate messages include the matching saved link when available.</p><p class="es">Las comprobaciones de duplicados permanecen separadas por plataforma. Facebook se compara con registros de Facebook y la Company Website Library; OfferUp con OfferUp; Craigslist con Craigslist. Los mensajes de duplicado exacto incluyen el enlace coincidente cuando está disponible.</p><p class="zh">查重仍按平台范围执行：Facebook 只与 Facebook 记录和 Company Website Library 比较；OfferUp 只比 OfferUp；Craigslist 只比 Craigslist。发现精确重复时，提示会尽量带出已匹配的保存链接。</p><p class="zh-tw">重複檢查仍按平台範圍執行：Facebook 只與 Facebook 記錄和 Company Website Library 比較；OfferUp 只比 OfferUp；Craigslist 只比 Craigslist。發現精確重複時，提示會盡量帶出已匹配的儲存連結。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h4>Dashboard status</h4><p class="en">Posting Activity continues to show your actual post count against the historical Daily target. Good / Bad / Unreviewed is controlled by Admin Post Review. A post that Admin permanently deletes is removed from the database and no longer participates in future duplicate checks.</p><p class="es">Posting Activity sigue mostrando el número real de publicaciones frente al Daily target histórico. Good / Bad / Unreviewed lo controla Admin Post Review. Una publicación eliminada permanentemente por Admin se elimina de la base de datos y deja de participar en futuras comprobaciones de duplicados.</p><p class="zh">Posting Activity 继续按历史 Daily target 显示实际发帖数量。Good / Bad / Unreviewed 由 Admin 的 Post Review 控制。Admin 永久删除的 Post 会从数据库移除，以后也不再参与查重。</p><p class="zh-tw">Posting Activity 繼續按歷史 Daily target 顯示實際發帖數量。Good / Bad / Unreviewed 由 Admin 的 Post Review 控制。Admin 永久刪除的 Post 會從資料庫移除，以後也不再參與重複檢查。</p></div></div></section><section class="section" id="daily"><h2><span class="en">Recommended daily Sales routine</span><span class="es">Rutina diaria recomendada para Ventas</span><span class="zh">建议的 Sales 每日操作流程</span><span class="zh-tw">建議的 Sales 每日操作流程</span></h2><div class="checklist"><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Publish Marketplace listings normally.</span><span class="es">Publica anuncios de Marketplace normalmente.</span><span class="zh">正常在 Marketplace 发布帖子。</span><span class="zh-tw">正常在 Marketplace 發布貼文。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Paste the day's listing URLs into Bulk Submit and monitor Verification Queue until they pass or show a clear error.</span><span class="es">Pega las URL del día en Bulk Submit y revisa Verification Queue hasta que pasen o muestren un error claro.</span><span class="zh">把当天的帖子 URL 放进 Bulk Submit，并查看 Verification Queue，直到通过或出现明确错误。</span><span class="zh-tw">把當天的貼文 URL 放進 Bulk Submit，並查看 Verification Queue，直到通過或出現明確錯誤。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Confirm every successfully published listing appears on Dashboard under the correct published date.</span><span class="es">Confirma que cada anuncio publicado correctamente aparezca en el Panel bajo la fecha de publicación correcta.</span><span class="zh">确认每个成功帖子都出现在正确 Published date 下。</span><span class="zh-tw">確認每個成功貼文都出現在正確 Published date 下。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Watch the Posting Activity chart against your Daily target.</span><span class="es">Compara el gráfico de Actividad de publicaciones con tu objetivo diario.</span><span class="zh">看 Posting Activity 是否达到 Daily target。</span><span class="zh-tw">看 Posting Activity 是否達到 Daily target。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Use Unreviewed to see what is still waiting for Admin.</span><span class="es">Usa Unreviewed para ver qué sigue esperando revisión del administrador.</span><span class="zh">用 Unreviewed 查看还在等 Admin 审核的帖子。</span><span class="zh-tw">用 Unreviewed 查看還在等 Admin 審核的貼文。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">Use Bad to find posts that need attention.</span><span class="es">Usa Bad para localizar publicaciones que necesitan atención.</span><span class="zh">用 Bad 找出需要处理的帖子。</span><span class="zh-tw">用 Bad 找出需要處理的貼文。</span></div></div><div class="check"><div><span class="en">If a wrong record must be removed, submit a deletion request with a clear reason.</span><span class="es">Si debe eliminarse un registro incorrecto, envía una solicitud de eliminación con un motivo claro.</span><span class="zh">如果记录确实错误需要删除，提交 deletion request 并写清原因。</span><span class="zh-tw">如果記錄確實錯誤需要刪除，提交 deletion request 並寫清原因。</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="trouble"><h2><span class="en">Common messages and what to do</span><span class="es">Mensajes comunes y qué hacer</span><span class="zh">常见提示与处理方法</span><span class="zh-tw">常見提示與處理方法</span></h2><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th data-help-static-en="Message / Situation" data-help-static-es="Mensaje / situación">Message / Situation</th><th data-help-static-en="Meaning" data-help-static-es="Significado">Meaning</th><th data-help-static-en="Action" data-help-static-es="Acción">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="Unsupported URL" data-help-static-es="URL no compatible">Unsupported URL</td><td><span class="en">The verifier does not recognize the submitted host as Facebook Marketplace, OfferUp or Craigslist.</span><span class="es">El verificador no reconoce el host enviado como Facebook Marketplace, OfferUp o Craigslist.</span><span class="zh">验证器不支持这个 URL host。</span><span class="zh-tw">驗證器不支持這個 URL host。</span></td><td><span class="en">Paste one complete supported listing/share URL.</span><span class="es">Pega una URL completa de anuncio/enlace compartido compatible.</span><span class="zh">重新复制完整的受支持帖子链接。</span><span class="zh-tw">重新復製完整的受支持貼文連結。</span></td></tr>
