<tr><td data-help-static-en="Verification failed / invalid" data-help-static-es="Verificación fallida / no válida">Verification failed / invalid</td><td><span class="en">The queued listing could not complete verification with its current data.</span><span class="es">El anuncio en cola no pudo completar la verificación con sus datos actuales.</span><span class="zh">队列中的帖子无法用当前数据完成验证。</span><span class="zh-tw">隊列中的貼文無法用目前資料完成驗證。</span></td><td><span class="en">Use Edit &amp; Re-verify if the URL needs correction, or Retry to verify the same URL again.</span><span class="es">Usa Edit &amp; Re-verify si debes corregir la URL, o Retry para volver a verificar la misma URL.</span><span class="zh">URL 需要修改时用 Edit &amp; Re-verify；原链接直接重试时用 Retry。</span><span class="zh-tw">URL 需要修改時用 Edit &amp; Re-verify；原連結直接重試時用 Retry。</span></td></tr>
<tr><td data-help-static-en="No listing image" data-help-static-es="Sin imagen del anuncio">No listing image</td><td><span class="en">A provider did not return an image. The post may still have valid text/content.</span><span class="es">Un proveedor no devolvió una imagen. La publicación aún puede tener texto/contenido válido.</span><span class="zh">Provider 没抓到图片，但文字内容仍可能有效。</span><span class="zh-tw">Provider 沒抓到圖片，但文字內容仍可能有效。</span></td><td><span class="en">Open Original if you need to visually confirm the listing.</span><span class="es">Abre Original si necesitas confirmar visualmente el anuncio.</span><span class="zh">需要人工确认时点 Open Original。</span><span class="zh-tw">需要人工確認時點 Open Original。</span></td></tr>
